usage: session_cli.py [-h] [--live] [--config CONFIG]
                      [--observation OBSERVATION] [--output OUTPUT]

Explicit functional-session CLI. Default is PLAN_ONLY; live requires local
files. SIGINT/SIGTERM stops new work. An already published worker command is
allowed to expire under its existing <=5s command deadline; no remote cancel
is invented. The output directory is exclusive per run, so restart never
replays a session.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --live
  --config CONFIG
  --observation OBSERVATION
  --output OUTPUT
